{"bookId": "574017", "title": "21世纪资本论", "bookmarks": {"synckey": 1702402439, "updated": [{"bookId": "574017", "bookmarkId": "574017_12_3318-3420", "createTime": 1671711599, "range": "3145-3247", "markText": "资本主义第二基本定律（以下简称“第二定律”）的公式反映了一个浅显但重要的事实：储蓄较多而增长缓慢的国家将在长期中积累起更大数量的资本（相对于收入而言），而巨额资本反过来会对社会结构和财富分配产生重大影响。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 37}, {"bookId": "574017", "bookmarkId": "574017_10_7789-8061", "createTime": 1671336715, "range": "7652-7827", "markText": "重要的一点是，这些巨大的净国外资产让英法两国得以在19世纪后期到20世纪早期维持结构性的外贸赤字。1880～1914年，上述两国从世界其他地区进口的商品和服务明显多于其出口，平均贸易赤字约为国民收入的1%～2%。但赤字并不构成问题，因为它们从国外资产中获得的收入超过了国民收入的5%，使其国际收支依然保持大量盈余，并年复一年地增加国外资产的持有数量。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 35}, {"bookId": "574017", "bookmarkId": "574017_8_33433-33764", "createTime": 1670513985, "range": "33592-33922", "markText": "18世纪，人均收入增长极慢。英国人在19世纪头10年代早期的平均收入约为每年30英镑—那是简·奥斯汀的创作时期￼—和我们在1720年或1770年看到的平均收入水平是一样的。因此在奥斯汀成长时，这些数字成了非常稳定的参照点。她非常清楚，要想过上舒适优雅的生活，拥有惬意的交通、服饰、美食、娱乐以及足够数量的仆人，一个人至少要有20～30倍于平均水平的收入。她书中的人物只有在年收入达到500～1000英镑时，才会感觉到手头比较宽裕。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 33}, {"bookId": "574017", "bookmarkId": "574017_8_29490-29491", "createTime": 1670512758, "range": "29490-29491", "markText": "[插图]", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 8}, {"bookId": "574017", "bookmarkId": "574017_8_14777-14973", "createTime": 1670423824, "range": "14738-14934", "markText": "购买力的乘数达到20、10或者6，有什么具体含义？这显然并不代表2012年欧洲人生产和消费的商品与服务比1913年多6倍。例如，平均的食品消费显然没有增加6倍。如果消费有那么大幅度的增长，说明基本的饮食需要早就满足了。对欧洲乃至其他任何地区来说，从长期来看，购买力的提高和生活水平的改善主要依靠消费结构的改进，即消费者的购物篮最初主要是装满了食品，逐渐让位于更为多样化的产品（制造品和服务）。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 33}, {"bookId": "574017", "bookmarkId": "574017_8_13729-13801", "createTime": 1670423700, "range": "13693-13765", "markText": "经济发展则来源于生活方式、消费和生产的产品及服务类型的多样化，因此必然是个多维度的发展过程，这个本质使其不可能用简单的货币化指数进行完美的概括。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 33}, {"bookId": "574017", "bookmarkId": "574017_8_12486-12689", "createTime": 1670423453, "range": "12448-12651", "markText": "例如曾经在法国七月王朝担任地方行政长官的自由派经济学家查尔斯·迪努瓦耶（Charles Dunoyer）在1845年发表的《论工作自由》（De la liberté du travail）一书中表达了此类观点（当然也表达了他对任何形式的劳动法规或社会法规的反对态度）:“工业体系的影响之一就是摧毁人为的不平等，但这只是更加清楚地凸显了自然的不平等。”", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 33}, {"bookId": "574017", "bookmarkId": "574017_8_4122-4236", "createTime": 1670421844, "range": "4013-4127", "markText": "累积增长定律在本质上等同于累积收益定律。累积收益定律的含义是几个百分点的年收益率经过数十年的叠加，会自动引起原始资本数额的巨幅增长。其前提条件是收益不断地用于再投资，或者资本所有者只把一小部分（相对于社会的增长率）收益用于消费。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 33}, {"bookId": "574017", "bookmarkId": "574017_7_32745-32777", "createTime": 1670341047, "range": "32742-32774", "markText": "在任何情况下，全球人均产出的趋同也并不意味着全球人均收入的趋同。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 32}, {"bookId": "574017", "bookmarkId": "574017_7_25470-25471", "createTime": 1670340111, "range": "25470-25471", "markText": "[插图]", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 7}, {"bookId": "574017", "bookmarkId": "574017_7_14220-14367", "createTime": 1670335478, "range": "14030-14177", "markText": "α=r×β是一个纯粹的会计恒等式。根据定义，该等式适用于所有社会的所有历史阶段。这个公式应当被视为资本主义第一基定律，因为它用简洁直白的方式阐释了资本/收入比、资本收入和资本收益率这三个概念之间的关系，这些概念对于研究资本主义制度非常重要", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 32}], "removed": [], "chapters": [{"title": "第三章 资本的变迁", "chapterUid": 35, "chapterIdx": 10}, {"title": "第二章 增长：幻觉与现实", "chapterUid": 33, "chapterIdx": 8}, {"title": "第一章 收入和产出", "chapterUid": 32, "chapterIdx": 7}, {"title": "第五章 资本/收入比的长期变化趋势", "chapterUid": 37, "chapterIdx": 12}], "book": {"bookId": "574017", "version": 816924930, "format": "epub", "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/17/574017/s_574017.jpg", "title": "21世纪资本论", "author": "托马斯·皮凯蒂", "coverBoxInfo": {"blurhash": "KQSFOnozL~enayfkHYaykV", "colors": [{"key": "1/4", "hex": "#1b1f00"}, {"key": "1/6", "hex": "#1a2000"}, {"key": "1/8", "hex": "#1a2100"}, {"key": "2/4", "hex": "#30330a"}, {"key": "2/6", "hex": "#2f3500"}, {"key": "2/8", "hex": "#2d3600"}, {"key": "3/4", "hex": "#484a1f"}, {"key": "3/6", "hex": "#474b00"}, {"key": "3/8", "hex": "#464c00"}, {"key": "3/12", "hex": "#424e00"}, {"key": "4/6", "hex": "#606416"}, {"key": "4/10", "hex": "#5f6600"}, {"key": "4/4", "hex": "#606332"}, {"key": "5/10", "hex": "#798000"}, {"key": "5/4", "hex": "#7a7d4a"}, {"key": "5/8", "hex": "#7a7f00"}, {"key": "6/4", "hex": "#949762"}, {"key": "6/6", "hex": "#959946"}, {"key": "6/8", "hex": "#949a23"}, {"key": "6/12", "hex": "#949b00"}, {"key": "7/8", "hex": "#afb441"}, {"key": "7/10", "hex": "#afb50a"}, {"key": "7/12", "hex": "#afb600"}, {"key": "8/4", "hex": "#cacc91"}, {"key": "8/6", "hex": "#cace76"}, {"key": "8/12", "hex": "#cad100"}, {"key": "9/2", "hex": "#e5e5c3"}, {"key": "9/12", "hex": "#e6ec13"}, {"key": "1/100", "hex": "#949a23"}, {"key": "2/100", "hex": "#afb441"}, {"key": "3/100", "hex": "#ffffff"}, {"key": "4/100", "hex": "#F3F1E5"}, {"key": "5/100", "hex": "#F3F1E5"}, {"key": "6/100", "hex": "#271E00"}], "dominate_color": {"hex": "#ffffed", "hsv": [59.76930965505627, 6.984945825109761, 99.879813308092]}, "custom_cover": "https://weread-1258476243.file.myqcloud.com/bookalphacover/17/574017/s_574017.jpg", "custom_rec_cover": "https://weread-1258476243.file.myqcloud.com/bookreccover/17/574017/s_574017.jpg", "colorsPure": ["#949b00", "#afb600"]}}}, "reviews": {"reviews": [{"reviewId": "17408780_7EEuifpp8", "review": {"bookId": "574017", "content": "中国目前也属于国家资本主义，与法国的辉煌30年类似，我们大概是辉煌了50年。", "bookVersion": 347024366, "range": "24293-24442", "abstract": "尽管这个历史插曲相对短暂，我们却很有必要了解法国人直至今天对于私人资本主义的复杂态度。在整个“辉煌30年”期间，国家得到重建，经济增长强劲，超过法国历史上任何其他时期。当时的法国实行混合经济，在某种意义上说是没有资本家的资本主义，或者至少可以说是规模最大的一些企业不再受私人资本控制的国家资本主义。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 35, "reviewId": "17408780_7EEuifpp8", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1671545086, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "574017", "format": "epub", "version": 816924930, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/17/574017/s_574017.jpg", "title": "21世纪资本论", "author": "托马斯·皮凯蒂", "translator": "巴曙松等", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 10, "chapterTitle": "第三章 资本的变迁", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7EEtipBM1", "review": {"bookId": "574017", "content": "中国目前推出的共同富裕背后的原因是不是因为想要使用通货膨胀快速减轻公共债务呢？", "bookVersion": 347024366, "range": "21194-21287", "abstract": "特别是，凯恩斯明显感觉到，尽管由于对1914年前的金本位制度无比留恋，英国人依然很不情愿接受通货膨胀，但这却是削减公共债务负担、减轻过去的财富积累影响力最便捷（虽然不见得最公正）的办法。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 35, "reviewId": "17408780_7EEtipBM1", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1671544172, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "574017", "format": "epub", "version": 816924930, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/17/574017/s_574017.jpg", "title": "21世纪资本论", "author": "托马斯·皮凯蒂", "translator": "巴曙松等", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 10, "chapterTitle": "第三章 资本的变迁", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7EBcRIMS1", "review": {"bookId": "574017", "content": "是吧…", "bookVersion": 347024366, "range": "10130-10214", "abstract": "诚然，公共资本与私人资本的划分既不会改变一个国家的国民资本的总量，也不会影响上文所述资本构成。不过，财产权利在政府与私人之间的区分在政治、经济和社会方面都具有重大意义。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 35, "reviewId": "17408780_7EBcRIMS1", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1671358719, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "574017", "format": "epub", "version": 816924930, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/17/574017/s_574017.jpg", "title": "21世纪资本论", "author": "托马斯·皮凯蒂", "translator": "巴曙松等", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 10, "chapterTitle": "第三章 资本的变迁", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7EAPcYYUf", "review": {"bookId": "574017", "content": "不得不感叹，英法两国的国民是真的富有啊。", "bookVersion": 347024366, "range": "8758-8808", "abstract": "英法两国目前的人均国民收入大约为每年3万欧元，国民资本约为6年的国民收入，也就是每人18万欧元左右。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 35, "reviewId": "17408780_7EAPcYYUf", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1671337046, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "574017", "format": "epub", "version": 816924930, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/17/574017/s_574017.jpg", "title": "21世纪资本论", "author": "托马斯·皮凯蒂", "translator": "巴曙松等", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 10, "chapterTitle": "第三章 资本的变迁", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 2}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7EAP2xKV6", "review": {"bookId": "574017", "content": "不知道在香港回归之前，香港的资本是算在国内资本还是国外资本？", "bookVersion": 347024366, "range": "8200-8274", "abstract": "到20世纪50年代，英法两国的净国外资产持有量都接近于零，意味着两个昔日的殖民帝国拥有的国外资产仅仅与世界其他地区在英法两国国内拥有的资产数额相当。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 35, "reviewId": "17408780_7EAP2xKV6", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1671336892, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "574017", "format": "epub", "version": 816924930, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/17/574017/s_574017.jpg", "title": "21世纪资本论", "author": "托马斯·皮凯蒂", "translator": "巴曙松等", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 10, "chapterTitle": "第三章 资本的变迁", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7Emlz8QoA", "review": {"bookId": "574017", "content": "最“文学”的经济学书籍。", "bookVersion": 347024366, "range": "708-720", "abstract": "财富的本质：从文学到现实", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 35, "reviewId": "17408780_7Emlz8QoA", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1670514686, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "574017", "format": "epub", "version": 816924930, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/17/574017/s_574017.jpg", "title": "21世纪资本论", "author": "托马斯·皮凯蒂", "translator": "巴曙松等", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 10, "chapterTitle": "第三章 资本的变迁", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7EmjHzPU4", "review": {"bookId": "574017", "content": "根据皮凯迪的预测，全球经济增速在2030年会进入转折点，但也会保持在较高的增长率。不过基于前面的论述，经济增长主要来自于科技的发展，所以这个预测也只能算是个猜想而已。", "bookVersion": 347024366, "range": "29490-29491", "abstract": "", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 8, "reviewId": "17408780_7EmjHzPU4", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1670512979, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "574017", "format": "epub", "version": 816924930, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/17/574017/s_574017.jpg", "title": "21世纪资本论", "author": "托马斯·皮凯蒂", "translator": "巴曙松等", "payType": 1048577}, "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7EmiSwXZR", "review": {"bookId": "574017", "content": "经济政策，政治制度对经济增长的影响远远无法与科技发展相比。", "bookVersion": 347024366, "range": "26661-26786", "abstract": "一旦这些国家赶上世界技术发展的前沿，它们的增长就不再快于英美两国，所有发达国家的增长速度基本趋于相同，也是顺理成章的事（见图2.3，后文还将对此继续讨论）。大致说来，英美两国的经济自由化政策对这个直观的事实也几乎没有影响，既没有提高也没有降低增长率。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 33, "reviewId": "17408780_7EmiSwXZR", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1670512224, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "574017", "format": "epub", "version": 816924930, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/17/574017/s_574017.jpg", "title": "21世纪资本论", "author": "托马斯·皮凯蒂", "translator": "巴曙松等", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 8, "chapterTitle": "第二章 增长：幻觉与现实", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7EmiBxpL1", "review": {"bookId": "574017", "content": "很好奇二战期间的GDP或者人均产值是如何计算的，武器消耗，人力消耗，战地医院等等战争资源是如何评估的，因为这些产能本质上没有产生任何价值。", "bookVersion": 347024366, "range": "25106-25184", "abstract": "在1930～1950年人均产值增速的确有所放缓，降至略高于1.5%，此后在1950～1970年又提升到2%之上，在1990～2012年再次降至不足1.5%。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 33, "reviewId": "17408780_7EmiBxpL1", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1670511973, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "574017", "format": "epub", "version": 816924930, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/17/574017/s_574017.jpg", "title": "21世纪资本论", "author": "托马斯·皮凯蒂", "translator": "巴曙松等", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 8, "chapterTitle": "第二章 增长：幻觉与现实", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7EkL8YCf5", "review": {"bookId": "574017", "content": "中国在计算GDP时是否计算了公共医疗，公共教育部分？", "bookVersion": 347024366, "range": "20460-20826", "abstract": "同时还应注意，国民账户统计习惯上并不计算对医院、中小学和大学的建筑及设备的公共资本的补偿，结果导致把医疗和教育服务私有化的国家会人为地显著拔高国内生产总值，而生产出来的服务和员工得到的工资其实没有变化。这种以成本为基础的统计方法可能使医疗和教育的基本“价值”被低估，这些服务领域快速扩张时期的增长率也可能被低估。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 33, "reviewId": "17408780_7EkL8YCf5", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1670424519, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "574017", "format": "epub", "version": 816924930, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/17/574017/s_574017.jpg", "title": "21世纪资本论", "author": "托马斯·皮凯蒂", "translator": "巴曙松等", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 8, "chapterTitle": "第二章 增长：幻觉与现实", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7EkKyiPts", "review": {"bookId": "574017", "content": "也就是我们常说的三产，工业，农业，服务业。", "bookVersion": 347024366, "range": "15731-15750", "abstract": "标准的做法是区分出三种类型的商品和服务", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 33, "reviewId": "17408780_7EkKyiPts", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1670423977, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {